cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Vade in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Vade: a thin-core, module-first agent runtime"
abstract: >-
  Vade is an agent runtime whose core stays thin: it only owns connection,
  routing, the turn loop, keys and audit. Tools, memory, models and clients are
  separate processes that attach to it.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Vade contributors"
